#: setup.php
msgid "How often do you wish Cacti to Export Graphs.  This is the unit of Polling Cycles you wish to export Graphs."
msgstr "Ufuna i-Cacti ithumele ngaphandle Iigrafu kangaphi.  Le yiyunithi yeMijikelo ye-Polling ofuna ukuthumela ngaphandle Iigrafu ngayo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Polling Cycle"
msgstr "Kumjikelo we-Polling Ngamnye"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Polling Cycles"
msgstr "Rhoqo ngemijikelo ye-Polling eyi-%d"

#: setup.php
msgid "Hourly at specified minutes"
msgstr "Ngeyure ngemizuzu echaziweyo"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an hourly basis, put the minutes of the hour when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 43 would equal 40 minutes past the hour."
msgstr "Ukuba ufuna i-Cacti ithumele ngaphandle imifanekiso engashukumiyo ngeyure nganye, faka imizuzu yeyure yokwenza oko. I-Cacti ithatha ngokuba uqhuba iskripthi sokuqokelela idatha rhoqo ngemizuzu emi-5, ngoko iya kusondeza ixabiso lakho kwelona lisondeleyo kwixesha layo lokusebenza. Umzekelo, 43 iya kulingana nemizuzu engama-40 emva kweyure."

#: setup.php
msgid "Daily at specified time"
msgstr "Imihla ngemihla ngexesha elichaziweyo"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an daily basis, put here the time when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 21:23 would equal 20 minutes after 9 PM."
msgstr "Ukuba ufuna i-Cacti ithumele ngaphandle imifanekiso engashukumiyo yonke imihla, faka apha ixesha lokwenza oko. I-Cacti ithatha ngokuba uqhuba iskripthi sokuqokelela idatha rhoqo ngemizuzu emi-5, ngoko iya kusondeza ixabiso lakho kwelona lisondeleyo kwixesha layo lokusebenza. Umzekelo, 21:23 iya kulingana nemizuzu engama-20 emva kwe-9 PM."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use x Threads"
msgstr "Sebenzisa ii-Thread ezi-x"

#: setup.php
msgid "How many background threads do you wish Cacti to use when exporting graphs.  Default is 0 to run all export in poller thread, 1 or more to spawn separate background threads"
msgstr "Ufuna ukuba i-Cacti isebenzise iintambo zangasemva ezingaphi xa ithumela ngaphandle iigrafu.  Okungagqibekanga ngu-0 ukusebenzisa konke ukuthumela ngaphandle kwintambo ye-poller, i-1 okanye ngaphezulu ukuvula iintambo zangasemva ezahlukeneyo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Graph Selection & Settings"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa kweGrafu neeSetingi"

#: setup.php
msgid "The user name to utilize for establishing permissions to Cacti Graphs.  This user name will be used to determine which Graphs/Trees can be exported.  N/A means don't assume any security is in place."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi eliza kusetyenziselwa ukuseka iimvume zeeGrafu zeCacti. Eli gama lomsebenzisi liza kusetyenziswa ukufumanisa ukuba zeziphi Iigrafu/Imithi ezinokuthunyelwa ngaphandle. I-N/A ithetha ukuba ungacingi ukuba kukho ukhuseleko olukhoyo."

#: setup.php
msgid "The Tree(s) to export."
msgstr "Umthi/Imithi oza kuthunyelwa ngaphandle."

#: setup.php
msgid "Expand Devices/Sites"
msgstr "Yandisa Izixhobo/Iziza"

#: setup.php
msgid "This setting determines if Tree Devices and Site Templates and Devices will be expanded or not.  If set to expanded, each host will have a sub-folder containing either Graph Templates or Data Query items."
msgstr "Le setingi imisela ukuba Izixhobo zoMthi kunye neeTempleyiti zeSiza neZixhobo ziya kwandiswa na okanye akunjalo. Ukuba isetelwe ekwandisweni, ihosti nganye iya kuba nefolda engaphantsi equlethe Iitempleyiti zeGrafu okanye izinto zoMbuzo weDatha."

